    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classTitleScreen" kindref="compound">TitleScreen</ref> class is responsible for the GUI of the title screen, its main functionality is to gather game options set by the user, then starting a game by creating a Tic Tac Toe controller with the user options. </para>
